    {
      "text": "%spark\nretailDF.repartition(8).explain\n/**\n//\nExchange RoundRobinPartitioning(8), REPARTITION_BY_NUM, [plan_id=459]\n   earlier        now\n   part-1         part-1\n\n   part-2         part-2\n\n   ..             --\n   ..             ..\n   part-7         part-7\n                  part-8\n\n\nspark will take 1 row from part-1 will put in part-1\n                2nd row from part-1 will put in part-2\n                 ......................   part-3\n                                          part-8\n**/",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/scala",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
          "language": "scala",
          "editOnDblClick": false,
          "completionKey": "TAB",
          "completionSupport": true
        }
      },
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      },
      "id": "3be926d59d0646cc98fd5"
    },
    {
      "text": "####UnderStanding *explain*\n\nThere are two type of Transformation.\n\n1. **Narrow Transformation:**  one input memory partition contribute to one output memory partition \n\n   *i.g:   filter/where, sortBy,*\n   - select, withColumn , withColumnRenamed\n   - map(), mapPartition(), flatMap(), filter(), union() , reduce()\n\n\n2. **Wide Transformation:** one input memory partition contribute to more than one output memory paritions\n   \n    - groupByKey() and reduceByKey() and  aggregateByKey(), aggregate(), join(), repartition() \n    - groupBy, count, distinct, aggregatefunciont on groupby\n",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
          "language": "markdown",
          "editOnDblClick": false,
          "completionKey": "TAB",
          "completionSupport": true
        }
      },
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      },
      "id": "a6b249689899451db19c7"
    },
    {
