    {
      "text": "\n\n### Predicate Pushdown\n\nHere is example reading from a JDBC source, where Catalyst determines that *predicate pushdown* can take place.",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "editorSetting": {
